# Affinity for Forests counts lands by type, not by name or "basic" (CR 702.41a, 205.3i): Temple Garden is a Forest Plains
# (here tapped, which does not matter), so with it as the only land {6}{G}{G} costs {5}{G}{G}, paid exactly by seven Mox
